.nh
.TH "ORBIT" "1" "Aug 2026" "Orbit Developer Platform" "Orbit Platform Manual"

.SH NAME
orbit-audit-tests - Report repositories with no tests and GitHub Actions usage


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBorbit audit tests [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Report repositories with no tests and GitHub Actions usage


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for tests

.PP
\fB--remote\fP[=false]
	Read GitHub Actions billing through gh


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--config\fP=""
	Custom path to Orbit CLI configuration file

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	Print the report as a JSON envelope


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBorbit-audit(1)\fP
